OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 2 APR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings, including Gorecki's
OL,8,     GSymphony No. 3 and recent chamber
OL,9,     Gmusic recordings from the
OL,10,     GCrucible, Sheffield.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,12,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod examines how
OL,14,     GLeonarda's music gained a wider
OL,15,     Gaudience beyond the walls of her
OL,16,     Gconvent.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham is joined live in
OL,19,     Gstudio for a performance by a
OL,20,     Gnewly announced New Generation
OL,21,     GArtist.
